<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About – Battle Royale</title>

  <!-- Tailwind Output CSS -->
  <link href="/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="bg-black text-white">

  <!-- Header Include -->
  <%- include('header') %>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="relative h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center text-center">
    <img src="/images/gaming setup.jpg"
         class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40" alt="">

    <div class="relative z-10">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-yellow-400 drop-shadow-lg">
        About – Battle Royale
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Enter the battleground where only the strongest survive. Learn more about our vision,
        mission, and the world of our battle royale game.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MAIN ABOUT INFO -->
  <section class="w-[95%] md:flex m-auto py-20 gap-20">

  <div class="w-1/2 des">

  <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6">The Game</h2>

  <!-- Section 1 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">A World Full of Thrill and Survival</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    Every match drops you into a high-stakes battleground where danger lurks behind every corner. 
    From abandoned factories to dense forests and shattered cities, the environment itself becomes 
    part of the challenge. Each location is carefully designed to offer opportunities for ambush, 
    loot, and tactical advantage.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 2 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">Dynamic Matches, Endless Possibilities</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    No two matches ever feel the same. With randomized loot, varying safe zones, and unpredictable 
    enemies, the battlefield constantly evolves. Adapt quickly, plan smartly, and stay alert—your 
    decisions determine whether you become the last survivor.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 3 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">Weapons That Feel Real and Powerful</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    Choose from an expanding arsenal of weapons—from precision snipers and rapid-fire SMGs to 
    explosive launchers. Each weapon has unique handling, recoil, and damage, giving players full 
    control over their style of combat.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 4 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">Compete, Survive, and Dominate</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    Whether you're a lone wolf entering the battlefield alone or teaming up with your squad, 
    teamwork and tactics are crucial. Communication, positioning, and synchronization give you the 
    power to outsmart your opponents and claim victory.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 5 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">Smooth Controls and Fast-Paced Action</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    The gameplay is optimized for quick response, fluid shooting mechanics, and seamless movement. 
    Slide, climb, jump, or sprint—every action is designed to keep the adrenaline flowing and the 
    gameplay engaging.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 6 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">Unlock Rewards and Upgrade Skills</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    As you progress, complete missions, unlock rare items, upgrade your characters, and customize 
    your loadouts. Every victory and every challenge gives you new opportunities to grow stronger.
  </p>

  <!-- Section 7 -->
  <h3 class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold mb-2">A Community of Warriors</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
    Join millions of players from around the world. Participate in tournaments, team up with 
    friends, or challenge rivals. Our community thrives on passion, competition, and the hunger to 
    be the last one standing.
  </p>

  <a href="/contact"
     class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-600 text-black font-bold rounded-xl transition shadow-xl">
    Contact Us
  </a>

</div>

    <div class="w-1/2 flex items-center">
    <img src="/images/character.jpg"
         class="w-full drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_#facc15]" alt="">
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- GAME FEATURES -->
  <section class="w-[90%] mx-auto pb-20">

    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-yellow-400 mb-12">
      Why Players Love This Game
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">

      <div class="bg-[#111] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-yellow-500/20">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-yellow-300">🔥 Intense Action</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">
          Fast-paced survival, real-time combat, and heart-pounding moments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#111] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-yellow-500/20">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-yellow-300">🎯 Tactical Gameplay</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">
          Smart decisions and strategic positioning mean the difference between
          victory and defeat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#111] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-yellow-500/20">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-yellow-300">⚔️ Unique Characters</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">
          Each character has unique abilities that can turn the tide of battle.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include('footer') %>

</body>
</html>
